<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">Human-Centred LLM Privacy Audits: Findings and Frictions</h1>
<span class="ltx_pubnotes ltx_pubnotes_meta"><span class="ltx_pubnotes_content"><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_conference"><span class="ltx_note_name">Conference: </span>Human-centered Evaluation and Auditing of Language Models (HEAL) at CHI; May 2026; Barcelona, Spain</span><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_ccs"><span class="ltx_note_name">CCS: </span>Human-centred computing Empirical studies in HCI</span><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_ccs"><span class="ltx_note_name">CCS: </span>Security and privacy Human and societal aspects of security and privacy</span><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_ccs"><span class="ltx_note_name">CCS: </span>Computing methodologies Natural language processing</span></span></span>
<div class="ltx_authors">
